  "description": {
   "en": "Konno Mayuko calls herself secretary to erotic novelist Utsugi Kosuke. In fact, she is Utsugi Kosuke himself. The secret to his creativity is a stoic daily life of abstinence. The desires that have been building up all at once become lewd delusions and overflow onto the manuscript paper...! A spin-off of \"Man's Time\", today alone again, he awakens to the eroticism of Utsugi Kosuke as he uses his own body to create an erotic and interesting erotic novel."
